   "examples/xhs_opensource/envelope.json",
   "examples/xhs_opensource/evidence_seed.json"
  ],
  "note": "examples/ 共享冻结 fixture 保持引用未拷贝(supplier_b responses 与 e2e 测试共用,防分叉);v1.0 发布时打包"
 },
